# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  NEVER COMMIT — credentials and keys.
#  A private repo is not a safe place for these: anyone who ever gets read
#  access (a collaborator, a compromised account) gets working credentials,
#  and git keeps them in history forever even after you delete the file.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
service-account*.json
*.pem
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
key.properties
bridge-config.php
.env
.env.*
wp-config.php
# ⚠️ Caught by the pre-commit scan: the ERP's Laravel environment file is named
# plain "env" with no dot, so a .env rule does not catch it. It holds the LIVE
# database and mail passwords.
env
**/env
# Rank Math export — carries a live Google Maps API key and the Search Console
# verification token.
rank-math-settings*.json
*-settings-20*.json

# ── Customer / business data — personal information, never in a code repo ───
*.csv
inFlow_*
*orders*.json
*customers*.json

# ── Big binaries: GitHub rejects files over 100 MB, and these are rebuilt ───
*.apk
*.aab
*.zip
*.log
# renamed/backup copies slip past the rules above (a 106 MB .apk.bak
# once blocked a push and had to be stripped from history)
*.apk.bak
*.aab.bak
*.bak

# ── Junk ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
~$*

# ── Video / large media: GitHub rejects files over 100 MB. Keep videos on
#    the PC (or Drive), never in the code backup. (Blocked pushes Sep–Oct 2026)
*.mp4
*.m4v
*.mov
*.mkv
*.avi
*.webm
*.wav
*.psd
*.m4a
*.mp3

# ── Photo/media libraries and tool caches — not code ──────────────────────
breo/Product Pic & Video/
breo/Product Description & Main Images/
aunstore/projector picture/
**/chrome-prof/
**/_shots/
**/_stills/
**/output/
romantic/
*.tflite
*.pma
